<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pūbes</span></b>  (nom. pubis,
				<i><span class="en">Prud. Cath. 7, 162</span></i>),
		is, f.
		1. pubes, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the signs of manhood</i>, i. e. <i>the
				hair which appears on the body at the age of puberty</i>, Gr.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥβη</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si inguen jam pube contegitur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					7, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillus et pubes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 8, 19, § 58</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The hair</i> in gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ciliorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 2, § 132</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The private parts</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 3,
				427</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. Am. 3, 12, 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 11,
				37, 83, § 208</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 15, 60, §
			215</span></i>; <i><span class="en">App. M. 10, p. 254,
			3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			Collect., <i>grown-up males</i>, <i>youth</i>, <i>young men</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnem Italiae pubem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Mil. 23, 61</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 5, 573</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">robora pubis Lecta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 8, 518</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Romana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 1,
					9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tac.
				A. 6, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. H. 2, 47</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 1,
				667</span></i>.—<b>Poet.</b>, transf., of
				<i>bullocks</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3,
				174</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> In gen., <i>men</i>, <i>people</i>, <i>population</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pube praesenti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 1, 1, 124</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cat. 64, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">268</span></i>; <i><span class="en">68, 101</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Dardana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 219</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">captiva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 3, 5, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Romana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 4, 46</span></i>
			 al.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>fulness</i>, <i>ripeness</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pube agri variorum seminum laeti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 24, 5, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
